OL,3,ANew UK-EU treaty has 10-year
OL,4,Atermination clause
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government and the EU are set to
OL,7,Fpublish the texts of two treaties that
OL,8,Fwere agreed last week as part of a
OL,9,Fpost-Brexit reset.
OL,11,FThe treaties will be published on
OL,12,FThursday afternoon, alongside
OL,13,Flegislation which is designed to enact
OL,14,Fthe bulk of the deal.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
