OL,3,ANew UK-EU treaty has 10-year
OL,4,Atermination clause
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC understands the deal covering
OL,7,Ffood exports has a 10-year termination
OL,8,Fclause that would mean if one party
OL,9,Fended the agreement, they would have to
OL,10,Fpay to rebuild border checks
OL,11,Finfrastructure, which will be
OL,12,Fsignificantly scaled back as part of
OL,13,Fthe new deal.
OL,15,FOpposition leader Kemi Badenoch has
OL,16,Fsaid she would scrap the deal and
OL,17,FReform UK's Nigel Farage has suggested
OL,18,Fhe would refuse to pay.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
